"""Outcome verification for the OpenSheet desktop application.

The stored workbook list is read from the browser Local Storage area and
compared with the final state declared by the task: the workbook title, the
sheet count, the cell values and formulas of the first sheet, its notes,
styles, view settings, filters, the second sheet cells, and an exported
workbook file when the task declares one.
"""

